# Scenario 'mail_errors': おくる/うけとる under network faults. Every attempt is a power cycle (`reset`: SRAM and adapter configuration kept, the
# adapter session restarts) followed by title -> top menu -> メール -> おくる/うけとる -> はい -> start, with one fault set through the `net`
# directive before the dial: SMTP failures at connect/HELO/MAIL/RCPT/DATA/end-of-data (the saved reply of 'mail_inbox' is in the outbox), POP3
# failures at connect/USER/PASS/STAT/TOP/RETR/DELE (mails waiting on the fake server), DNS NXDOMAIN/timeout, TCP refused/reset, and the adapter
# unplugged in the middle of the session. The screenshot of each attempt is taken 3500 frames after the start. Starts from the state left by
# 'mail_inbox'. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
# --- smtp_connect
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
net smtp_fail=connect
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
wait 3500
shot smtp_connect
tap A
wait 1500
shot smtp_connect_2
net smtp_fail=none
